  "description": "Dev.D is a 2009 Indian Hindi-language romantic drama film written and directed by Anurag Kashyap. It is a modern-day adaptation of Sarat Chandra Chattopadhyay's 1917 Bengali novel, Devdas. The film stars Abhay Deol, Mahie Gill and Kalki Koechlin in lead roles. The film is set in modern-day Punjab and Delhi, and follows Devendra Singh \"Dev\" Dhillon, a privileged young man who descends into alcohol and drug addiction after a failed relationship with his childhood love Parminder \"Paro\" Kaur, eventually forming an unexpected bond with Chanda, an escort navigating her own emotional trauma.",
